      "content": "I'm not sure I follow the \"goblin bridge\" idea—can you explain what that looks like in a practical, technical sense? Are you suggesting we implement an intermediate mapping layer or a middle-tier ontology to facilitate the transformation, and how would that actually look in terms of the actual RDF triples or data structures?",
